# State keywords (v0.3): alone on their line, they are about the element itself (its self locator).
# At most one state of each family per block: Enable/Disable, Check/Uncheck, Editable/ReadOnly,
# Focus, Empty.
Screen: Settings

  Element: Newsletter Checkbox
    Enable

    When: The user is new
    Uncheck

    When: The user subscribed
    Check

  Element: Email Field
    Editable
    Empty

    When: The email field was clicked
    Focus

  Element: Account ID Field
    ReadOnly
